rder-color-error,#b22222);color:var(--color-base,#202122)}</style><div class=\"licenseContainer licenseBanner dynlayout-exempt\">\n<div><div><div><div>\n<p><span class=\"imageLeft\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/60px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/120px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"196\" data-file-height=\"196\" /></span></span></span>\n</p>\n</div><div>\n<div>\n<p>这部作品在1931年1月1日以前出版，其作者1948年逝世，在<b>美國</b>以及版權期限是<b>作者終身加75年</b>以下的國家以及地区，屬於<b><a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%AC%E6%9C%89%E9%A0%98%E5%9F%9F\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:公有領域\">公有領域</a></b>。\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>这部作品也可能在本國本地版權期限更長，但對外國外地作品應用較短期限規則的國家以及地区，屬於<b>公有領域</b>。\n</p>\n</div>\n</div><div>\n<p><span class=\"noimageRight\"></span>\n</p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"licensetpl\">\n<p><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;short\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;long\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;link&#95;req\">false</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;attr&#95;req\">false</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.codfw.main‐79d6c85fd6‐c2tvf\nCached time: 20260712095542\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Template:Pd/1923 (#time)\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.100 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.184 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 185/1000000\nRevision size: 394/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 15442/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 666/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip po